"⟪k:0⟫And she had not summoned only her personal servants, but others as well—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫including "
"the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女自身の侍女だけでは足りず、⟪k:1⟫そこには、⟪k:2⟫あの白い髪をした娘の姿もありました。"

