#: scenario:scenario_7C0F1664_0F95_4494_82E9_FB82AF0BF61F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fa7d4e377f170c768f4c0432552d4582e30ae5ec2f2a5d51ed959043a8aca13
