msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hey! Who put this ugly vase here?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ちょっとぉ、⟪k:3⟫誰よこんな悪趣味な壺を持ってきたの……！"

#: scenario:scenario_22099220_71EA_44D4_8451_2534C281178C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3318b01d2dc3fdc8c2341d0f56b5dea9e7f268eac2a42105cfa1e4519786eef4
